  "motion": {
    "ease": "cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94)",
    "ease-out": "cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)",
    "reveal": "0.8s fade and 20px rise, once, when a block scrolls into view",
    "library": "A question is typed, then the answer and its sources arrive. Two slow loops: a filter chip and a calendar row.",
    "reduced": "With reduced motion on, or without JavaScript, everything is shown complete and still.",
    "hero": "GSAP. Arrival: the picture settles from 1.1 to 1 over 2.4s, the title rises line by line (1.1s each, 0.12s apart), then the paragraph and the button fade up. At rest: the picture rises and falls between 1 and 1.03 over 14s. Scroll: the picture scales from 1.04 to 1.12 and the text lifts 44px and fades. Pointer, on wide screens with a mouse: the picture leans up to 8px away from the cursor."
